                                "sense_id": "1c591138-c0b3-3b62-bb9a-c3b0d2ca34b2",
                                "text": "All the new interns had heard of his operative speed, his finesse under the attending's glare, and his memorization of the current surgical literature."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5c2b83b-0de9-4aab-9317-6cbc1d263d77",
                                "sense_id": "1c591138-c0b3-3b62-bb9a-c3b0d2ca34b2",
                                "text": "All too often when taking a history, residents and attendings in a hurry will simply use the cut-and-paste function to save time and bypass asking potentially important questions that have been asked before."
                            }
                        ]
